# Raw OpenVizsla traces and their full parses run from 50 MB to 2.25 GB and
# stay out of the repo, as README.md states. Only the reduced outputs and the
# written analyses are versioned.
#
# Nothing enforced this before, so a plain "git add -A" in this directory
# would have committed well over half a gigabyte.

*.txt
*.pcap
*.bz2

# ...except the reduced and extracted products, which are small and are the
# whole point of keeping the tooling.
!*_reduced.txt
!*_events.txt
!*_no-audio.txt
!*_truncated.txt
!*_stripped.txt
